      "id": "root_daily",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 📅 2026-10-21 デイリートレンド\n\n**🔥 本日の最重要ニュース**\nテスラとSpaceXの合併検討が正式確認：評価額3.5兆ドル規模の巨大テックコングロマリット誕生へ\n\n[出典リンク](https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmlyl09xjke4o)"
    },
    {
      "id": "entities_summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/OpenAI|OpenAI]]\n- [[Entities/Google|Google]]\n- [[Entities/Anthropic|Anthropic]]\n- [[Entities/Microsoft|Microsoft]]\n- [[Entities/AWS|AWS]]\n- [[Entities/Tesla|Tesla]]\n- [[Entities/xAI|xAI]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/transformer|transformer]]\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/GPT|GPT]]\n- [[Technologies/agentic|agentic]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "purpose_ai_research",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": -390,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
